reated a duplicate payment (PAY0002). I reversed the duplicate, and the reversal is confirmed. The vendor received the $3,697.44 once, but the reversal shows as a clawback on the payment list, so you may want to confirm with the vendor that the duplicate has been returned to us.\n\nNo controller approval was needed because the amount is under the $10,000 threshold. Harbor Logistics's other invoices were not touched: INV-49944 was already paid, and INV-75277 is a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}